    "template_id": "1914407"
}</action_input>

Thought: <thought>Good, the first template worked. Now let's apply template 1914406 to the second fragment 'FC1CN(Cc2ccc(CCl)cc2)C1'</thought>
Action: <action>apply_template</action>
Action Input: <action_input>{
    "molecule_smiles": "FC1CN(Cc2ccc(CCl)cc2)C1",
    "template_id": "1914406"
}</action_input>

Thought: <thought>Great, now let's apply the final template 1914407 to 'FC1CN(Cc2ccccc2)C1'</thought>
Action: <action>apply_template</action>
Action Input: <action_input>{
    "molecule_smiles": "FC1CN(Cc2ccccc2)C1",
    "template_id": "1914407"
}</action_input>

Thought: <thought>Now I have all the pieces to construct the retrosynthesis route JSON. The route will show:
1. The target molecule splitting into the aminotriazole and benzyl chloride parts
2. The benzyl chloride part converting to dichloromethane and the fluoroazetidine
3. The fluoroazetidine converting to the oxetane

Let me format this as the required JSON.</thought>
Final Answer: {
  "type": "mol",
  "smiles": "COc1cccc(NC(=O)c2nnn(Cc3ccc(CN4CC(F)C4)cc3)c2N)c1",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "reaction",
      "template_id": "1914405",
      "children": [
